  "notes": "CONJUGATION: {乗|の}っ{取|と}る is a godan verb ({五段|ごだん}). Te-form: {乗|の}っ{取|と}って. Passive: {乗|の}っ{取|と}られる.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {会社|かいしゃ}を{乗|の}っ{取|と}る (to take over a company)\n- アカウントを{乗|の}っ{取|と}る (to hijack an account)\n- {飛行機|ひこうき}を{乗|の}っ{取|と}る (to hijack an airplane)\n\nIn modern usage, account hijacking ({乗|の}っ{取|と}り) on social media and online services is an extremely common context for this word.",
